<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:41:58 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>病毒能对抗癌症吗？图德里克夫对黑色素瘤患者意味着什么</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/can-viruses-fight-cancer-what-tudriqev-means-for-patients-with-melanoma</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:41:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/can-viruses-fight-cancer-what-tudriqev-means-for-patients-with-melanoma</guid></item><item><title>薛定谔的错误造成了量子测量问题</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/schrodingers-blunder-created-the-quantum-measurement-problem</link><description>量子力学被认为挑战了科学提供对我们头脑之外的现实的客观描述的观点。 “测量问题”似乎表明观察行为创造了观察到的结果。但物理学家安东尼·瓦伦蒂尼（Antony Valentini）的《超越量子》（Beyond the Quantum）被李·斯莫林（Lee Smolin）誉为“本世纪最好的量子力学书籍”，他认为这一图景是基于埃尔文·薛定谔（Erwin Schrödinger）的巨大错误。在路易斯·德布罗意预测了粒子的波状轨迹后，薛定谔找到了描述这一点的方程。但是，德布罗意设想的是粒子在波上行驶，而薛定谔则保留了波并扔掉了粒子。这个单一的决定引发了衡量问题——而且这是完全没有必要的。瓦伦蒂尼认为，复活德布罗意最初的基于粒子的理论，我们就可以消除量子之谜。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/schrodingers-blunder-created-the-quantum-measurement-problem.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:26:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/schrodingers-blunder-created-the-quantum-measurement-problem</guid></item><item><title>技术失业：人工智能驱动型经济中劳动力的未来</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/tech-unemployment-the-future-of-labor-in-an-ai-driven-economy</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/tech-unemployment-the-future-of-labor-in-an-ai-driven-economy2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:11:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/tech-unemployment-the-future-of-labor-in-an-ai-driven-economy</guid></item><item><title>癌症中的铁死亡对胰腺癌的分子见解和临床转化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ferroptosis-in-cancer-toward-molecular-insights-and-clinical-translation-in-pancreatic-cancer</link><description>铁死亡是一种由铁积累和脂质过氧化驱动的细胞死亡的调节形式。自从被认为是调节细胞死亡的一种方式以来，铁死亡因其独特的代谢和氧化还原依赖性而在癌症研究中引起了越来越多的关注。最近的证据表明，铁死亡源于整合代谢重编程、基因和RNA控制以及细胞器间通讯的系统级调节，同时影响免疫重塑和肿瘤微环境。这些过程共同决定铁死亡的易感性和治疗反应。铁死亡相关基因和通路也已成为风险分层、治疗预测和基于成像评估的潜在生物标志物。此外，能够调节铁死亡的小分子诱导剂、靶向抑制剂和递送系统显示出克服多种恶性肿瘤（包括胰腺癌）治疗耐药性的转化潜力。这篇综述综合了最新的机制和转化进展，强调铁死亡作为细胞代谢和肿瘤治疗之间的概念桥梁，并概述了精确诊断和个性化干预的前景。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ferroptosis-in-cancer-toward-molecular-insights-and-clinical-translation-in-pancreatic-cancer.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 14:56:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ferroptosis-in-cancer-toward-molecular-insights-and-clinical-translation-in-pancreatic-cancer</guid></item><item><title>美国宇航局紧急将工程师赶出实验室。他们说这会给未来的太空任务带来风险</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nasa-rushed-engineers-out-of-their-labs-they-say-it-risks-future-space-missions</link><description>美国宇航局员工表示，由于该机构在过去几个月突然搬迁，他们失去了制造复杂航天器所需的重要设备和人员。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nasa-rushed-engineers-out-of-their-labs-they-say-it-risks-future-space-missions.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 14:41:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nasa-rushed-engineers-out-of-their-labs-they-say-it-risks-future-space-missions</guid></item><item><title>机器人培训模拟人生</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/robotics-training-sims</link><description>一位 Coinbase 工程师连接了完整的&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/robotics-training-sims.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 14:26:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/robotics-training-sims</guid></item><item><title>科学家们一次将图像传送到 100 个量子通道</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-just-teleported-an-image-across-100-quantum-channels-at-once</link><description>量子隐形传态即将改变世界。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-just-teleported-an-image-across-100-quantum-channels-at-once.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 14:11:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-just-teleported-an-image-across-100-quantum-channels-at-once</guid></item><item><title>研究发现，关节置换术中的金属颗粒可以到达您的大脑</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/metal-particles-from-joint-replacements-can-reach-your-brain-study-finds</link><description>慢性髋部、膝部或肩部疼痛通常需要进行全关节置换。这可以减轻疼痛并恢复活动能力，但会带来其他健康风险吗？ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/metal-particles-from-joint-replacements-can-reach-your-brain-study-finds.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 13:56:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/metal-particles-from-joint-replacements-can-reach-your-brain-study-finds</guid></item><item><title>地球磁场中不断出现奇怪的信号——目前还没人知道它是什么</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-strange-signal-keeps-turning-up-in-earths-magnetic-field-and-no-one-knows-what-it-is-yet</link><description>物理学家在全球范围内寻找&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-strange-signal-keeps-turning-up-in-earths-magnetic-field-and-no-one-knows-what-it-is-yet2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 13:41:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-strange-signal-keeps-turning-up-in-earths-magnetic-field-and-no-one-knows-what-it-is-yet</guid></item><item><title>一名 3 岁儿童的转移性癌症在两次实验治疗后消失</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-3-year-olds-metastatic-cancer-disappeared-after-two-doses-of-experimental-therapy</link><description>抗癌医学的巨大进步已经实现了非凡的新里程碑。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-3-year-old